<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3360739669618444113..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Blowback, Provocation, and Perpetual War</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>14</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1348545036577106771</id><published>2010-09-16T23:02:24.179-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-16T23:02:24.179-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Double-plus good, SA!</title><content type='html'>Double-plus good, SA!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1348545036577106771'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1348545036577106771'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284699744179#c1348545036577106771' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 16, 2010 at 11:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7419113989950191465</id><published>2010-09-16T17:48:35.514-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-16T17:48:35.514-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Bob, Oceania has always been at war with Eurasia a...</title><content type='html'>Bob, Oceania has always been at war with Eurasia &lt;i&gt;and&lt;/i&gt; Eastasia. Remember your doublethink.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/7419113989950191465'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/7419113989950191465'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284680915514#c7419113989950191465' title=''/><author><name>Sans Authoritas</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-592747932"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 16, 2010 at 5:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6964172880697415057</id><published>2010-09-15T00:45:26.325-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-15T00:45:26.325-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I keep trying to remember where I am currently liv...</title><content type='html'>I keep trying to remember where I am currently living in.  Is it Oceania, Eurasia, or East Asia?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/6964172880697415057'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/6964172880697415057'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284533126325#c6964172880697415057' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 15, 2010 at 12:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4744809821633898994</id><published>2010-09-14T09:02:15.799-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-14T09:02:15.799-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Lemuel, take your own advise………………&#xa;“NOTHING IS WHA...</title><content type='html'>Lemuel, take your own advise………………&lt;br /&gt;“NOTHING IS WHAT IT SEEMS. EVERYTHING IS A LIE”</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/4744809821633898994'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/4744809821633898994'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284476535799#c4744809821633898994' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-854738010"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 14, 2010 at 9:02 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2733246832338934589</id><published>2010-09-13T23:24:48.209-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-13T23:24:48.209-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Zach, I hope you get to read this. &#xa;&#xa;I also was co...</title><content type='html'>Zach, I hope you get to read this. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I also was convinced, as you are, that WTC7 was a demolition job. The way it collapsed from the bottom falling inwards towards the middle was too perfect. Many demolition experts looked at the tapes and said, that was indeed a controlled demolition. Also, the fact that the BBC announced in London that the building had fallen 20 minutes BEFORE it actually fell was too much to swallow. Also, the fact that no steel-frame building ever fell before just from internal fires was too powerful a truth.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;However, I changed my mind. Go read the article on Wikipedia. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(1) It had 47 floors. After it was built, the intended tenant went bankrupt, and it was rented to another trading firm, who had the building retrofitted to accomodate a trading floor by removing THREE ENTIRE FLOORS of the building on the lower floors (I think 5 through 7), leaving a hollow shell which had to be reinforced by hundreds of tons of steel. This weakened the original structure - it was no longer an intact matrix of steel girders, but had a great big hole in the middle of the matrix near the bottom.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(2) It also housed a Con Ed substation and an emergency management department, with huge transformers which weighed many tons, situated on various floors up to the ninth. There were several heavy emergency generators and large tanks of diesel fuel on different floors. The building was not built to support these extra loads.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(3) When the North Tower fell, a massive chunk of that building tore a huge hole in the south face of WTC7, from the tenth to the second floors (if I remember right,) extending about halfway into the depth of the building. This again took out most of the remaining support on the lower floors in the center of the building, which was the first to collapse - just like a controlled demolition.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(4) Finally, you had the fires, fueled by the diesel tanks and the contents of the building. The sprinkler system was defunct and the fire hoses did not work, since the collapse of WTC1 and WTC2 had severed all the water mains in lower Manhattan, and there was no water pressure. The firefighters you saw playing hoses on the wreckage for days to weeks afterwards were being supplied by the NYC fleet of fire boats, moored alongside the WTC in the Hudson River, and pumping water from the river to fight the fires in the WTC.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(5) A couple of hours before WTC actually fell, the walls started to bulge outwards, indicating the whole structure was sagging. The fire chief pulled out all his personnel from the building and they were just waiting for it to collapse. It was a foregone conclusion. It was inevitable, and everyone on the scene could see it. This was the reason why the BBC jumped the gun and said it had collapsed, 20 minutes early. They misheard what they were being told, that it was going to collapse any minute.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This has nothing to do with Mr. Grigg&amp;#39;s essay, but this rumor or WTC7 controlled demolition has to be put to rest so we can focus on more important issues, which are: Who knew beforehand about the 9/11 plot, and said nothing? That is the real issue. I for one believe the President, Dick Cheney, and several others were fully aware of the entire plot.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I hope you will go and read the Wiki article on this subject.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/2733246832338934589'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/2733246832338934589'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284441888209#c2733246832338934589' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2010 at 11:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1872112904512376367</id><published>2010-09-13T21:32:59.005-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-13T21:32:59.005-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another terrorist plot staged by the Feds was the ...</title><content type='html'>Another terrorist plot staged by the Feds was the Murrah Building bombing in OKC.  Elohim City was crawling with ATF and other federal agents.  In fact, there may have been more agents than regular members!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1872112904512376367'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1872112904512376367'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284435179005#c1872112904512376367' title=''/><author><name>Louis</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11711343543256743613</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-867595729"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2010 at 9:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8408443699282591720</id><published>2010-09-13T21:14:10.891-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-13T21:14:10.891-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article. These cases are so pathetic, but th...</title><content type='html'>Great article. These cases are so pathetic, but the people are so indifferent and stupid the establishment can get away with anything.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s even worse. A reasonable person looks at videos of building 7 falling (many reasonable people have forgotten that a third building fell) and realizes that it indeed underwent controlled demolition. What exactly happened on 9/11 may never be known, but proof of the conspiracy follows from the fact that wtc 7 blew up. It&amp;#39;s understandable that intelligent people don&amp;#39;t want to admit that it was an inside job, especially when there is no proof of what DID transpire. In proving certain properties of the integers, mathematicians accept mathematical induction as a valid proof method. Proofs by induction don&amp;#39;t let us &amp;quot;see&amp;quot; how something is true, but only that it is true. The same goes in the Kennedy assassination, for example. Don&amp;#39;t know what happened, but it wasn&amp;#39;t just Oswald. 9/11 however, is a much more important event. That day IS BEING USED TO ENSLAVE THE PLANET. Oh, how long Lord will you let the charade of that day stand?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/8408443699282591720'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/8408443699282591720'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284434050891#c8408443699282591720' title=''/><author><name>zach</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1163025153"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2010 at 9:14 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1207691126835946296</id><published>2010-09-12T21:58:45.012-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-12T21:58:45.012-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Liberranter, I&amp;#39;ll go with #2.  He was long dea...</title><content type='html'>Liberranter, I&amp;#39;ll go with #2.  He was long dead and gone but his ghost even now still serves his master.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And if Assange is an asset then its another depressing episode from a long list of two-timing clowns.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Back to Wills article... What gets me more than anything is that what we see are the Feds playing the role of agent provocateurs each and every time they &amp;quot;nab&amp;quot; those bad guys!... Ooooooh!  Its scary!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;They spend tax money.. i.e. their &amp;quot;budget&amp;quot; to rile people up and then bellow that they somehow swooped down and saved us from certain doom had they NOT.  If they hadn&amp;#39;t been the catalyst could we not argue that such things might not happen at all?  I believe that&amp;#39;s what  Will is saying.  But the Feds, naturally, turn the argument around or simply ignore it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1207691126835946296'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1207691126835946296'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284350325012#c1207691126835946296' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2010 at 9:58 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8199725082499418732</id><published>2010-09-12T10:57:21.481-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-12T10:57:21.481-06:00</updated><title type='text'>People, it is all a circus. Hear this: Julian Assa...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;People, it is all a circus. Hear this: Julian Assange works for the CIA, and leaks only what he is told to leak, for whatever purposes of the gubmint which it does not share with us. Cryptome is a CIA site. John Young works for them. I said it here before, and I say it again: NOTHING IS WHAT IT SEEMS. EVERYTHING IS A LIE.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That makes perfect sense, especially the part about Julian Assange being a CIA &amp;quot;asset.&amp;quot;  If Wikileaks was a truly &amp;quot;rogue&amp;quot; site, the full weight of the Regime&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;law enforcement&amp;quot; arm would have swung into action and the site would have been shut down within sixty minutes of the first round of &amp;quot;leaked&amp;quot; documents making their appearance.  That this did not happen and that Assange is still alive and breathing somewhere* seems to confirm your comment that &amp;quot;all is not what it seems.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(* The Regime&amp;#39;s most elite military forces &amp;quot;couldn&amp;#39;t find or capture&amp;quot; Osama bin Laden either, despite all their state-of-the-art surveillance equipment, massive firepower, and millions of dollars in bounty money.  This means that either 1) they didn&amp;#39;t really want him dead, as he was too useful a tool to lose, or 2) he was already dead even before 9/11&amp;#39;s events occurred, but it served the Regime too well to let his memory die along with him.  Ditto with Julian Assange, a &amp;quot;mere mundane&amp;quot; without the wealth, following, or resources of Bin Laden.  If the CIA or DoD really wanted him dead, he could easily have been tracked down and would have been on a slab weeks or months ago.  That this &amp;quot;public enemy number one&amp;quot;, as I expect to eventually hear him branded by the Regime&amp;#39;s propaganda mill, is still roaming some corner of the earth on two feet and with his insides intact testifies to the fact that he is another useful tool of the Regime who will be allowed to continue to exchange oxygen for carbon dioxide until he is no longer useful or until he starts to assert independence, at which point he&amp;#39;ll meet with &amp;quot;an unfortunate lethal accident.&amp;quot;)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/8199725082499418732'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/8199725082499418732'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284310641481#c8199725082499418732' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2010 at 10:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1806119277202652124</id><published>2010-09-12T00:14:57.434-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-12T00:14:57.434-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s our modern version of the Roman circus, i...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s our modern version of the Roman circus, in which Christians were used to stage &amp;quot;encounters&amp;quot; with wild animals, gladiators &amp;quot;fought&amp;quot; each other to the death, and entire naval battles were staged in the Colosseum, all to entertain the Plebes and keep them from thinking about their wretched lives of squalid misery, while the Senators, Consuls, Praetors, Emperors, and Sundry Nobles wallowed in obscene luxury. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(Meals of flamingo&amp;#39;s tongues and leopard eyeballs eaten off silver platters until they had to leave the feast to go vomit to make room for more outrageously exotic and expensive food.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What has changed? Today the victims get paraded in a court instead of being eaten by lions or trampled by elephants in the circus, for the entertainment of the crowds.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Speaking of entrapment, Mr. Grigg, Leviathan is the same everywhere, even in Muslim lands. Here is a story:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://blog.amnestyusa.org/deathpenalty/saudi-arabia-a-death-sentence-for-sorcery/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;about a dumb Sudanese sucker who went to Saudi Arabia on Hajj (pilgrimage to Mecca,) and was approached by a Saudi gubmint provocateur offering him $1,600 to write a spell &amp;quot;so the provocateur&amp;#39;s stepfather would leave his mother.&amp;quot; Hell, for $1,600 I would have written a spell myself. Now the poor Sudanese is facing the death penalty in Saudi Arabia - having his head chopped off with a massive sword - for &amp;quot;sorcery.&amp;quot; He is not alone - scores of gullible idiots were arrested and charged with &amp;quot;sorcery&amp;quot; in 2009 and 17 people have been executed by beheading SO FAR in 2010. Saudi justice. Keep the desert dummies deluded and docile.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In our American, mostly Christian society, &amp;quot;sorcery&amp;quot; does not make us as terrified as it once did in Salem, Massachussetts in 1640, so they inflict the bogeyman of &amp;quot;terrorism&amp;quot; upon us instead. (After staging 9-11 to get our attention and soften us up. Who can forget the people jumping from the 100th floor, and the 19,000 body fragments, some as small as a tooth, still waiting for DNA identification?) Every time the American sheeple start to relax and enjoy life, Leviathan whomps up another &amp;quot;terrorist&amp;quot; scare to keep us under control.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is a joke. It would be funny, if so many people did not take it seriously, and if Leviathan did not murder its own subjects every now and then to keep us alert and compliant.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(Notice this: Leviathan never targets the REALLY big taxpayers. It&amp;#39;s only the poor non-contributing schmucks who get entrapped.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;People, it is all a circus. Hear this: Julian Assange works for the CIA, and leaks only what he is told to leak, for whatever purposes of the gubmint which it does not share with us. Cryptome is a CIA site. John Young works for them. I said it here before, and I say it again: NOTHING IS WHAT IT SEEMS. EVERYTHING IS A LIE.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So stop worrying. Ignore it. Hug your wife or husband, kiss your kids, and wish for these minions of Satan a suitable sojourn in the depths of hell.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1806119277202652124'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1806119277202652124'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284272097434#c1806119277202652124' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2010 at 12:14 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1642826807790338703</id><published>2010-09-11T23:03:06.168-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-11T23:03:06.168-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s amazing how similar these tactics are to ...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s amazing how similar these tactics are to those used against the &amp;#39;militia movement&amp;#39; in the late &amp;#39;90s.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1642826807790338703'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1642826807790338703'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284267786168#c1642826807790338703' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-381772817"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 11, 2010 at 11:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-490052364355254372</id><published>2010-09-11T22:41:24.844-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-11T22:41:24.844-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Bob@9:28 - Well stated, and yeah, I&amp;#39;m with you...</title><content type='html'>Bob@9:28 - Well stated, and yeah, I&amp;#39;m with you there.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Somehow, my first comment sounded funnier and a lot less naive when I typed it!  We actually have a lot of terrorism facilitators in gov&amp;#39;t, with ATF and IRS making the list along with the ones you mentioned.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/490052364355254372'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/490052364355254372'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284266484844#c490052364355254372' title=''/><author><name>fireplaceguy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09137875201699993308</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1034232735"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 11, 2010 at 10:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1637918246366361285</id><published>2010-09-11T21:28:56.108-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-11T21:28:56.108-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Fireplaceguy- Just keep going with the logic you h...</title><content type='html'>Fireplaceguy- Just keep going with the logic you had there, add the FBI, CIA, and Military and what do you get? They trained the Mujahadeen, they did the MK Ultra programs, the atomic soldiers tests, the Tuskegee airmen experiments, faked the golf of Tonken etc, these are just some of the things that are admitted! Never mind the stuff they haven&amp;#39;t admitted, I would throw JFK assasination, OCK bomb, and 9/11 in the mix of things wings of the &amp;quot;government&amp;quot; has inflicted on us.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;After all, if they will detonate nuclear bombs next to our troops just to see what the radiation will do to them why wouldn&amp;#39;t they blow up buildings as a giant psychological operation on the public to get them to go along with their otherwise publically unaaceptable plans?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1637918246366361285'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/1637918246366361285'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284262136108#c1637918246366361285' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13487404072546513179</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='28' height='32' src='http://www.magixl.com/caric./star/luther.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-371125903"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 11, 2010 at 9:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6150026074968996102</id><published>2010-09-11T17:24:30.684-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-11T17:24:30.684-06:00</updated><title type='text'>We live in an age replete with government facilita...</title><content type='html'>We live in an age replete with government facilitators.  We have:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Insolvency facilitators (congress) &lt;br /&gt;Illiteracy facilitators (educrats)&lt;br /&gt;Drug addiction facilitators (DEA)  &lt;br /&gt;Brutality facilitators (cops)&lt;br /&gt;Fraud facilitators (SEC)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;and so on...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But terrorism facilitators?  That may be a bit over the top, even for our beloved feds.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/6150026074968996102'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3360739669618444113/comments/default/6150026074968996102'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html?showComment=1284247470684#c6150026074968996102' title=''/><author><name>fireplaceguy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09137875201699993308</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/09/blowback-provocation-and-perpetual-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3360739669618444113' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3360739669618444113' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedPr